{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Toss. Aim. Score \u2014 Urban Style.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>Urban Disc Golf</strong>, an arcade-inspired disc golf game where the concrete jungle becomes your playground. Whether you're curving a disc through alleyways or banking a trick shot off a rooftop, every course is packed with stylish scenery and sneaky targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate city parks, plazas, and rooftops in this low-poly 3D world \u2014 all while unlocking bonus achievements for hitting signs, bins, and hidden targets in your path.<br><br>\ud83e\udd4f <strong>Arcade-style disc golf</strong> set in an urban world</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Hit the basket</strong>... or go for <strong>bonus trick shot targets</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Stylized low-poly 3D visuals</strong> with a colorful city vibe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf06 <strong>Multiple levels</strong> inspired by real city layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67\u200d\ud83d\udc66 <strong>Family-friendly gameplay</strong> for all ages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Simple to play, challenging to master</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddd8\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Relaxing single-player experience</strong> \u2014 no timers, no stress</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3753060?t=1748694066","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753060/e6d0dcc8bb85c0b6a511ceb22b896525715d736f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748694066","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753060/b5fb460a2355a91053e112f9cae96e03790747ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748694066","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co